      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠣᠯᠭᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>bolγuqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>болгох</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BOLΓU-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. To let ripen or become mature; to cook until done; to cure, process; to refine, purify; to beware. Cf. bolγ-a- and bolγuγa-.</definition>
