    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠣᠯᠭᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>bolγuqu</uighur>
      <definition>To refine or work gold. To make ready. To cause to ripen. To spit out something which one is unable to chew or eat.</definition>
